	(descr "Arduino Mega 2560 R3 shield: header footprint for a board that plugs onto a Mega 2560 R3. Derived from the Giga R1 WiFi shield footprint, which shares the Mega form factor; the second analog header is corrected to A8-A15. The 2x3 ICSP header is NOT included - check clearance against a physical Mega before fabricating.")
